 making a purchase. By purchasing our services, you agree to the terms of this policy.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"2. Service Fees (Formation Packages)\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"2. Service Fees (Formation Packages)\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Our service fees for business formation and filing assistance are refundable according to the following schedule: (a) Full refund within 14 calendar days of purchase if we have not yet filed any documents with the state or commenced work on your order; (b) 50% refund if work has commenced but no state filing has been submitted; (c) No refund after state filing has been submitted. State processing times and outcomes are outside our control.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"3. State Filing Fees\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"3. State Filing Fees\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"State filing fees are paid directly to government agencies (Secretary of State, Department of Corporations, etc.) and are non-refundable once submitted. This applies regardless of the application outcome, including rejection or delay. We will inform you of state fees before submission.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4. Registered Agent Services\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"4. Registered Agent Services\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Registered agent service fees are refundable within 14 days of purchase if the service period has not yet begun. Once the service period starts, fees are earned and non-re