ble at any time; (b) You retain access until the end of your current billing period; (c) No partial refunds for unused portions of a billing period; (d) Annual subscriptions are refundable on a pro-rata basis for the unused portion, minus a 10% processing fee.\\\"}]]}]\\n38:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"7. Custom Development and Enterprise Services\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"7. Custom Development and Enterprise Services\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Custom software development, enterprise agreements, and consulting services are governed by the refund and cancellation terms specified in your individual service contract or statement of work. These typically include milestone-based payment schedules with refund terms tied to completed deliverables.\\\"}]]}]\\n39:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"8. Payment Disputes\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"8. Payment Disputes\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"If you believe a charge is incorrect, please contact us immediately at billing@wolfitpark.online. We will investigate and respond within 5 business days. Unresolved disputes may be submitted to your financial institution or through binding arbitration as described in our Terms \\u0026 Conditions.\\\"}]]}]\\n3a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"9. Refund Processing\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"9. Refund Processing\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Approved refunds are processed within 5-10 business days. Refunds are credited to your original payment method: (a) Credit/debit card refunds — 5-10 business days to appear on your statement; (b) Cryptocurrency refunds — processed within 24 hours, subject to blockchain network confirmations; (c) ACH/wire refunds — 5-7 business days. Cryptocurrency refunds are denominated in the original cryptocurrency at the exchange rate at the time of refund processing.\\\"}]]}]\\n3b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"10. Chargeback Policy\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"10. Chargeback Policy\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"If you initiate a chargeback with\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\" your financial institution before contacting us, your account may be immediately suspended. We will provide transaction records to your financial institution to dispute the chargeback. Wrongful chargebacks may result in a $25 administrative fee.\\\"}]]}]\\n3c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"11. Exceptions\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"11. Exceptions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Exceptions to this Refund Policy may be made at Wolfitpark's sole discretion in extraordinary circumstances. All exceptions must be documented in writing and approved by a Wolfitpark manager.\\\"}]]}]\\n3d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"12. Governing Law\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xl font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"12. Governing Law\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"This Refund Policy is governed by the laws of the State of Wyoming, United States. Any disputes regarding refunds shall be resolved through the dispute resolution process out